---
const STEP1_COPY = 'ssh-keygen -t ed25519\ncat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub';
const STEP2_COPY = "ssh -R dev:80:127.0.0.1:8080 ssh.edge.ng";
const TIP_COPY =
    'autossh -M 0 -o "ServerAliveInterval 30" -R dev:80:127.0.0.1:8080 ssh.edge.ng';
---

<section id="quickstart">
    <div class="wrap inner">
        <div class="head">
            <div class="lead">
                <div class="eyebrow">QUICKSTART</div>
                <h2>两步，把本地服务暴露到公网</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="sub">
                首次使用先把公钥交给管理员加入白名单，之后每次上线只需一条命令。
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="workbench">
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-header">
                        <span class="num">01</span>
                        <div class="heading">
                            <span class="label">配置公钥鉴权</span>
                            <span class="desc">生成密钥，把公钥交给管理员导入白名单，即时生效</span>
                        </div>
                        <button class="copy" data-copy={STEP1_COPY} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="code">
                        <div class="cl c-dim"># 本地：生成密钥（已有可跳过）</div>
                        <div class="cl c-cmd">$ ssh-keygen -t ed25519</div>
                        <div class="cl c-cmd">$ cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</div>
                        <div class="cl">&nbsp;</div>
                        <div class="cl c-dim"># 管理员在服务器上导入</div>
                        <div class="cl c-cmd">$ sudo sish-adduser alice "ssh-ed25519 AAAA..."</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-header">
                        <span class="num">02</span>
                        <div class="heading">
                            <span class="label">一条命令上线</span>
                            <span class="desc">SSH 反向端口转发，Ctrl-C 即下线；子域名被占用时自动分配随机子域名</span>
                        </div>
                        <button class="copy" data-copy={STEP2_COPY} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="code">
                        <div class="cl c-dim"># 指定子域名 → https://dev.edge.ng</div>
                        <div class="cl c-cmd">$ ssh -R dev:80:127.0.0.1:8080 ssh.edge.ng</div>
                        <div class="cl">&nbsp;</div>
                        <div class="cl c-dim"># 随机子域名 → https://xxx.edge.ng</div>
                        <div class="cl c-cmd">$ ssh -R 80:127.0.0.1:8080 ssh.edge.ng</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip">
                <span class="tip-tag">TIP</span>
                <span class="tip-text">需要长时间挂着？用 autossh 断线自动重连：</span>
                <code>autossh -M 0 -o "ServerAliveInterval 30" -R dev:80:127.0.0.1:8080 ssh.edge.ng</code>
                <button class="copy tip-copy" data-copy={TIP_COPY} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    #quickstart {
        position: relative;
        isolation: isolate;
        overflow: hidden;
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 12% 22%, rgba(194, 90, 53, 0.08), transparent 24rem),
            linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f1e6 0%, #f3ecdf 100%);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    #quickstart::before {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: -1;
        inset: 0;
        content: "";
        opacity: 0.42;
        background-image: radial-gradient(#b9aa94 0.75px, transparent 0.75px);
        background-size: 18px 18px;
        mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), transparent 35%, transparent);
        -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), transparent 35%, transparent);
    }
    .inner {
        padding-top: clamp(64px, 7vw, 96px);
        padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 8vw, 104px);
    }
    .head {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(300px, 0.8fr);
        gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 80px);
        align-items: end;
        margin-bottom: 34px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
        width: 28px;
        height: 1px;
        content: "";
        background: currentColor;
    }
    h2 {
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
        text-wrap: balance;
    }
    .sub {
        color: var(--ink-2);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 420px;
    }

    .workbench {
        padding: 14px;
        background: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid rgba(122, 95, 64, 0.2);
        border-radius: 22px;
        box-shadow:
            0 1px 1px rgba(56, 36, 18, 0.05),
            0 20px 55px rgba(67, 45, 24, 0.1);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .steps {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: stretch;
    }
    .step {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        min-width: 0;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 254, 251, 0.9);
        border: 1px solid #e5d9c7;
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(59, 40, 22, 0.035);
        transition:
            transform 0.22s ease,
            border-color 0.22s ease,
            box-shadow 0.22s ease;
    }
    .step:hover {
        z-index: 2;
        border-color: #d5bea5;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(59, 40, 22, 0.08);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .step:not(:last-child)::after {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 3;
        top: 50%;
        right: -17px;
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        content: "→";
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #a78f74;
        background: #f8f2e7;
        border: 1px solid #dacbb6;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
    .step-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .num {
        flex: none;
        padding-top: 3px;
        color: var(--terracotta);
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .heading {
        display: grid;
        min-width: 0;
        gap: 4px;
        flex: 1;
    }
    .label {
        color: #29241e;
        font-size: 14.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .desc {
        color: #7c7367;
        font-size: 11.5px;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .copy {
        flex: none;
        width: 28px;
        height: 26px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border: 1px solid #e0d3bf;
        background: #fbf6ed;
        color: #8a7c68;
        border-radius: 7px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 13px;
        transition:
            background 0.15s,
            color 0.15s;
    }
    .copy:hover {
        background: #f3e9d9;
        color: var(--terracotta-dark);
    }
    .code {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 26px 16px 18px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: auto;
        background:
            linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025), transparent),
            var(--term-bg);
        border: 1px solid #2c2924;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow:
            inset 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
            0 8px 18px rgba(31, 25, 20, 0.12);
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .code::before {
        position: absolute;
        top: 12px;
        left: 14px;
        width: 5px;
        height: 5px;
        content: "";
        background: #665b4d;
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow:
            9px 0 #514c43,
            18px 0 #3e4e37;
    }
    .cl {
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        word-break: break-all;
    }
    .c-dim {
        color: #8b8472;
    }
    .c-cmd {
        color: #d8d4ca;
    }

    .tip {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding: 13px 16px;
        background: rgba(246, 236, 228, 0.75);
        border: 1px solid #ecd9c9;
        border-radius: 13px;
    }
    .tip-tag {
        flex: none;
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: #fffaf5;
        background: var(--terracotta);
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .tip-text {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--ink-2);
        font-weight: 500;
    }
    .tip code {
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 11.5px;
        color: #6e4a35;
        background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.9);
        border: 1px solid #e5d3bd;
        padding: 4px 9px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
    }
    .tip-copy {
        margin-left: auto;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .head {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .steps {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .step:not(:last-child)::after {
            top: auto;
            right: 50%;
            bottom: -19px;
            content: "↓";
            transform: translateX(50%);
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 620px) {
        .inner {
            padding-left: 18px;
            padding-right: 18px;
        }
        .workbench {
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 17px;
        }
        .tip-copy {
            margin-left: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
